Z||000003||tgowens||07-23-2000||04:29 PM||||I had the same problem on my '87 GT - both front tires and one rear tire -- turned out to be worn shocks and struts (and of course you should have a four wheel alignment when you change them)<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/MY_SIGNATURE.gif">               <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A>||||reg||1
